# Static assets served at the site root.
#
# controls-demo.webm / controls-demo.mp4 / controls-demo-poster.png — the
# Risk & Controls demo loop, rendered by `demo-video`. WebM (VP9) is listed
# first for Chromium/Firefox; the MP4 (H.264) covers Safari and iOS:
#
#   cd ../demo-video
#   node scripts/render.mjs --preset=controls --preset=controls-webm
#   node scripts/still-controls.mjs
#   cp out/controls-demo.mp4 out/controls-demo.webm \
#      out/controls-demo-poster.png ../landing-page/public/
#
# The composition lives at demo-video/src/landing/ControlsDemo.tsx and uses
# the landing page's tokens. Regenerate both files together — the poster is a
# frame of the same render, so it can never show something the loop does not.
